/v1/","context":{"app_id":4103850,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1839041357038011","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - July","summary":"Hey everyone! Hope you are all having a lovely week. We have some fun little updates for Gemmy Gems that we wanna share today 💖First, we updated our tool assets. And by assets, I mostly mean the little tool icons! They look so much cuter now and really fit the cozy feeling of the shop way better than the old ones. We also updated the main menu! It looks and feels so much better now, and it really sets the right cozy mood before you even jump into the game. But our absolute favorite part is the n","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T11:16:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038011","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1836506165562546","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - June","summary":"Hello, fellow gem crafters! 💎We’ve been hard at work in the Gemmy Gems workshop, carefully chiseling away at new features to make your cozy journey even more magical. We have some exciting progress to share with you all in today’s devlog!Here is what we’ve been up to:🏪 Your Dream Shop Awaits (Shop Levels Integrated): Your cozy little workspace now has room to grow! We’ve successfully integrated the shop leveling system. As your reputation spreads and you successfully polish and sell more stones,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-30T13:44:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165562546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1833334318570776","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - May","summary":"Hello everyone! Welcome to our May update for Gemmy Gems. We have some exciting progress from the workshop to share with you this month.New Character Sprites We are currently working on brand new reaction sprites for our magical customers. Each character, from the demanding Witch to the shiny obsessed Goblin, will have unique expressions that reflect their personality. This will make your shop interactions feel much more alive and expressive when customers visit The Quest System We are also exci","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-22T05:52:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318570776","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1830163047265499","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - Hello Again! - Part 2","summary":"Hello again ✨Welcome to part two of our devlog catch-up! In our last post, we talked about the core loop and gem processing. Today, we want to show you what we have been doing to bring the world itself to life.🛠️ New NPCs for Tools You need good equipment to mine the best stones. Instead of buying upgrades from a standard menu, we added new NPCs to the town who specifically sell tools. It makes getting new gear feel like an actual interaction.🗣️ New Characters and Dialogues We added some new fac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-20T09:47:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047265499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1830163047260963","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Devlog - Hello Again! - Part 1","summary":"Hello again ✨It’s been a while. We haven't posted a devlog in a few months because we put our heads down and focused on building. A lot has changed, and Gemmy Gems is starting to play like the cozy gem shop management game we envisioned. Since we have so much to share, we are splitting this update into two parts!Here is the first look at what we’ve been up to:🔄 Connecting the Gameloop The core flow is now fully playable. You can dig up raw stones, process them, manage your inventory, and deal wi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T17:22:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047260963","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1819386365112750","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Gemmy Gems - December Devlog","summary":"Hello Again ✨ December was one of those months where nothing looks revolutionary at first glance, but everything suddenly starts to feel like a real game. Less dreaming, more finishing. Less “what if,” more “this actually works.”Our main goal this month was simple and slightly terrifying: Make Gemmy Gems playable for other people.🛠️ From 2D Concepts to Polished 3D ScenesSome of our 2D concept scenes didn’t translate well into Unity. We had already converted a few of them into 3D earlier, but thi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-29T11:44:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365112750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4103850-1817483467045465","game_id":"steam-4103850","kind":"announcement","title":"Gemmy Gems – November Devlog","summary":"Greetings I hope you had a great, cozy month. For us, it was a challenging but wholesome stretch full of satisfying work. All of our team members are focused on making the game playable, having fun while building it, and giving it as much soul and love as possible. We’re incredibly grateful that people already like it and are wishlisting it. It feels like a blessing. Your kind comments and feedback genuinely fuel us. So as I was saying, it’s been challenging. We prototyped lots of scenes, trying","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-01T14:04:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467045465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:37:53Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4103850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4103850":"2026-10-26T01:05:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4103850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5396260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:05:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4103850","app_id":4103850,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:28Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"fb7742eb9c1f2cc3e32a4b7306f0c0e341641e83737b74084257d7617d715040","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"아름다운 바이옴을 탐험하고 보석을 수집하며 정제하는 데 초점을 맞춘 편안한 보석 수집 및 가공 시뮬레이션 게임입니다.\r\n원석을 전시하거나 판매할 수 있는 보물로 다듬는 과정에서 인